        <div class="size-14 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-500 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="size-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#050315]">สร้างรหัสผ่านชั่วคราวสำเร็จ!</h3>
